-- phase: data
-- compatible-from: *
-- compatible-to: *
-- maintenance: false
-- Migration 525: company scoped copies of the reporting catalogue entries
-- that were not filtered by {{current.company}}. Each copy keeps the original
-- query and adds a company filter, so technicians can run it for a single
-- company. Copies use the original slug with a "-company-scoped" suffix and
-- the original name with a " (Company Scoped)" suffix. Settings rows with no
-- company (checks, rules, schedules, scripts, policies, closures) apply to
-- every company, so the copies include them. The original reports are not
-- changed. Reports with no link to a company (AI usage, RAG indexing,
-- webhooks, automations, product stock, global forms, continuity plans,
-- knowledge base scopes and marketing opt-outs) have no copy.
-- Idempotent via INSERT IGNORE on the unique slug.
